      "cooked": "<p>I'm so sorry if this has already been asked, but searching hasn't turned up anything on this...</p><p>I'm looking at Unforgiving Wasteland and it requires that a card be removed from the game. Does a card so removed go to the trash, or is it removed entirely?</p><p>Essentially, is it \"destroyed without triggering 'when destroyed' effects\", or is the card returned to the box such that it can't come back from the trash (which is how I initially interpreted \"removed from the game\").</p>",
