      "created_at": "2015-09-04T07:08:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When a card is taken out due to Unforgiving Wasteland, it is remvoed from the gam entirely <span class=\"bbcode-i\">instead</span> of being \"destroyed\", ie any \"when this card is destroyed…\" effects don't take place. Therefore having this card out alongside a Horrid Skunk Ape versus the Matriarch is a really amazingly good thing :D.</p>",
